WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.200
Your bus has been sitting in the yard for weeks?

2
00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:05.700
The listing brings enquiries, but no buyer.

3
00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.850
And every day costs parking space and money.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:14.180
ECS buys used buses, trucks and vans
directly from businesses.

5
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:18.680
You send photos, we assess quickly
and make a firm offer.

6
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.150
Payment is made directly,
our driver collects the vehicle.

7
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.780
We also handle export and customs clearance.

8
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.250
30 years in the vehicle trade.

9
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.900
Want to sell a vehicle? Give us a call.
